icism or incorporate alternative approaches. That indicates a potential weakness in adaptability and feedback orientation.\n* **Cooperation / crew interaction:**\u202fAlthough Candidate\u202fA has \u201cvery good leadership qualities,\u201d they are also described as a \u201cshow\u2011off.\u201d The show\u2011off perception can undermine constructive collaboration and may create friction with crew members.\nSo, while I lack explicit reliability data, the available evidence points to limited feedback receptivity and possible challenges in cooperative cockpit dynamics for Candidate\u202fA."}
